#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:4
msgid "Deployment"
msgstr "部署"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page gives complete deployment samples for the two long-running "
"components: a hub (``anet-hub`` with the optional ``anet-hub-admin``) and"
" a node (the ``anet`` daemon). Each is shown as a set of systemd units "
"and as a container image. The samples are starting points; the host "
"names, paths and account names are examples."
msgstr ""
"本页给出两个长期运行组件的完整部署示例:hub(``anet-hub``,可选 ``anet-hub-admin``)与节点(``anet`` "
"守护进程)。每个组件均以一组 systemd 单元和一个容器镜像两种形式给出。示例仅作起点,其中的主机名、路径和账户名均为示例值。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:18
msgid "Principles"
msgstr "基本原则"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Dedicated account.** Run each component under its own unprivileged "
"account. The data directory holds private keys and is created with mode "
"``0700``."
msgstr "**专用账户。** 每个组件以各自独立的非特权账户运行。数据目录保存私钥,创建时权限为 ``0700``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Loopback listeners.** A hub listens on a loopback address and a reverse"
" proxy terminates TLS (see :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`). A node's control plane "
"and local A2A interface are loopback-only and must not be published."
msgstr ""
"**仅监听回环地址。** hub 监听回环地址,由反向代理终结 TLS(参见 :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`)。节点的控制面与本地 "
"A2A 接口仅限回环访问,不得对外发布。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Secrets in files.** Tokens are kept in files readable by the service "
"account only and are never placed in a unit file, an image or a command "
"line."
msgstr "**密钥与令牌存放于文件。** 令牌保存在仅服务账户可读的文件中,不得写入单元文件、镜像或命令行。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Write access to the data directory only.** The units below mount the "
"file system read-only and open the data directory for writing."
msgstr "**仅数据目录可写。** 下列单元以只读方式挂载文件系统,仅对数据目录开放写入。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:31
msgid ""
"**One data directory, one process.** Two processes on the same hub data "
"directory, or two copies of one node identity running at the same time, "
"are both faults (see :ref:`ops-backup`)."
msgstr ""
"**一个数据目录,一个进程。** 两个进程共用同一个 hub 数据目录,或同一节点身份的两个副本同时运行,均属故障(参见 :ref:`ops-"
"backup`)。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:37
msgid "A hub with systemd"
msgstr "使用 systemd 部署 hub"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:39
msgid ""
"The installation uses one account, ``anet-hub``, for the hub, the "
"operator plane and the maintenance job. The operator plane writes to the "
"hub's database (to deregister an agent), so it needs the same account."
msgstr ""
"本安装为 hub、运维面和维护任务使用同一个账户 ``anet-hub``\\ 。运维面需要写入 hub 的数据库(用于注销 "
"Agent),因此必须使用相同账户。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:44
msgid "Account and files"
msgstr "账户与文件"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:56
msgid ""
"``deploy/hub-db-roll.sh`` is in the ANetHub repository. It needs the "
"``sqlite3`` command. The data directories are created by systemd from the"
" ``StateDirectory=`` lines of the units below."
msgstr ""
"``deploy/hub-db-roll.sh`` 位于 ANetHub 仓库中,需要 ``sqlite3`` 命令。数据目录由 systemd "
"根据下列单元中的 ``StateDirectory=`` 行创建。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:61
msgid "Hub unit"
msgstr "hub 单元"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:63
msgid "``/etc/systemd/system/anet-hub.service``:"
msgstr "``/etc/systemd/system/anet-hub.service``:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:113
msgid "Operator-plane unit"
msgstr "运维面单元"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:115
msgid ""
"The operator plane reads the token from ``/etc/anet-hub/admin.env``. "
"systemd reads that file before it drops privileges, so the file can be "
"owned by ``root`` with mode ``0600``. The unit is omitted entirely on a "
"hub that does not use the console."
msgstr ""
"运维面从 ``/etc/anet-hub/admin.env`` 读取令牌。systemd 在降权之前读取该文件,因此文件可由 ``root`` "
"持有,权限为 ``0600``\\ 。不使用控制台的 hub 可完全省略此单元。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:120
msgid "``/etc/systemd/system/anet-hub-admin.service``:"
msgstr "``/etc/systemd/system/anet-hub-admin.service``:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:169
msgid ""
"Without an ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` line in the file, or with a placeholder value,"
" the service does not start. Check a token before restarting the service:"
msgstr "文件中缺少 ``ADMIN_TOKEN`` 行,或其值为占位值时,服务不会启动。重启服务之前请先检查令牌:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:177
msgid "Maintenance job"
msgstr "维护任务"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:179
msgid ""
"``hub-db-roll.sh`` checkpoints the write-ahead log, writes the weekly "
"backup and prunes old backups (see :ref:`ops-backup`). It runs once a "
"day."
msgstr "``hub-db-roll.sh`` 对预写日志执行检查点、生成每周备份并清理旧备份(参见 :ref:`ops-backup`),每天运行一次。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:182
msgid "``/etc/systemd/system/hub-db-roll.service``:"
msgstr "``/etc/systemd/system/hub-db-roll.service``:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:212
msgid "``/etc/systemd/system/hub-db-roll.timer``:"
msgstr "``/etc/systemd/system/hub-db-roll.timer``:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:227
msgid "Start everything"
msgstr "启动全部服务"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:237
msgid ""
"Then set the recovery passphrase of the hub identity. The hub must be "
"stopped for this step, and the command must run in a terminal. Choose a "
"recovery-file location outside the data directory:"
msgstr "随后设置 hub 身份的恢复口令。此步骤须在 hub 停止时执行,且命令必须在终端中运行。恢复文件的位置应选在数据目录之外:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:249
msgid ""
"Copy ``hub.anetrec`` to separate storage. Later ``identity status`` and "
"``identity rotate`` commands name the same file with ``--recovery-file``,"
" because the service account has no home directory. Other operator "
"subcommands are run the same way, as the service account:"
msgstr ""
"将 ``hub.anetrec`` 复制到独立的存储中。由于服务账户没有主目录,之后的 ``identity status`` 与 "
"``identity rotate`` 命令须通过 ``--recovery-file`` 指定同一文件。其他运维子命令同样以服务账户的身份运行:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:258
msgid ""
"Finally publish the hub through the reverse proxy configuration shown in "
":ref:`ops-hub-proxy`, and request the certificate for the host name."
msgstr "最后,按 :ref:`ops-hub-proxy` 所示的反向代理配置发布 hub,并为该主机名申请证书。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:263
msgid "A hub in a container"
msgstr "使用容器部署 hub"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:265
msgid ""
"The project does not publish a container image. The following "
"``Containerfile`` builds a minimal one around a static ``anet-hub`` "
"binary (built with ``CGO_ENABLED=0``). The image has no shell; it holds "
"the binary and an empty, writable ``/data`` directory."
msgstr ""
"项目不发布容器镜像。下面的 ``Containerfile`` 围绕静态编译的 ``anet-hub`` 二进制文件(使用 "
"``CGO_ENABLED=0`` 构建)构建最小镜像。镜像不含 shell,仅包含该二进制文件和一个空的可写 ``/data`` 目录。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:282
msgid ""
"Build and start it. The port is published on the loopback interface of "
"the host only, so the reverse proxy remains the single public face:"
msgstr "构建并启动。端口仅发布在宿主机的回环接口上,因此反向代理仍是唯一的公开入口:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:296
msgid ""
"Arguments after the image name are appended to the entry point, so "
"``--public-url`` and the other options of :ref:`ops-hub` can be given "
"there. Operator subcommands run in a second container on the same volume."
" Set the recovery passphrase with the hub container stopped, and keep the"
" recovery file on a separate bind mount owned by the image's user (uid "
"65532):"
msgstr ""
"镜像名之后的参数会追加到入口点,因此可在此处给出 ``--public-url`` 以及 :ref:`ops-hub` "
"中的其他选项。运维子命令在使用同一数据卷的第二个容器中运行。设置恢复口令时须停止 hub "
"容器,并将恢复文件保存在单独的绑定挂载上,该挂载归镜像用户(uid 65532)所有:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:313
msgid ""
"The hub writes its log to standard error; ``docker logs anet-hub`` shows "
"it."
msgstr "hub 将日志写入标准错误输出,可用 ``docker logs anet-hub`` 查看。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:317
msgid "A node with systemd"
msgstr "使用 systemd 部署节点"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:319
msgid ""
"A node that must run without a logged-in user (a provider of public "
"capabilities, for example) is an ``anet daemon`` under its own account. "
"The data directory is ``ANET_DATA_DIR``. The command-line tool refuses to"
" talk to a daemon that runs under another user, so commands for the node "
"are run as its account."
msgstr ""
"需要在无登录用户的情况下运行的节点(例如公开能力的提供方)应以独立账户运行 ``anet daemon``\\ 。数据目录为 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``\\ 。命令行工具拒绝与以其他用户身份运行的守护进程通信,因此针对该节点的命令须以其账户身份执行。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:331
msgid "``/etc/systemd/system/anet-node.service``:"
msgstr "``/etc/systemd/system/anet-node.service``:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:385
msgid ""
"``RestrictNamespaces=yes`` and the system-call filter prevent the sandbox"
" of the auto-reply module from starting, because the sandbox creates "
"namespaces. A node that answers tasks with a sandboxed local agent needs "
"these two lines relaxed (see :ref:`topics-sandbox`)."
msgstr ""
"``RestrictNamespaces=yes`` 与系统调用过滤会使自动回复模块的沙箱无法启动,因为沙箱需要创建命名空间。使用沙箱化本地 "
"Agent 应答任务的节点,需要放宽这两行配置(参见 :ref:`topics-sandbox`)。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:390
msgid ""
"A small wrapper runs the command-line tool as the node's account with the"
" same environment:"
msgstr "一个简短的包装脚本以节点账户和相同的环境运行命令行工具:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:393
msgid "``/usr/local/bin/anet-node``:"
msgstr "``/usr/local/bin/anet-node``:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:412
msgid ""
"``hub-register`` asks for the recovery passphrase on the terminal and "
"writes the recovery file to ``/var/lib/anet-node/.anet-recovery/``, "
"outside the data directory. Copy that file to separate storage (see :ref"
":`ops-backup`). Without a terminal, registration still completes, and the"
" node reports that the identity has no recovery passphrase until ``anet "
"identity protect`` is run in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"``hub-register`` 在终端中请求输入恢复口令,并将恢复文件写入数据目录之外的 ``/var/lib/anet-node/.anet-"
"recovery/``\\ 。请将该文件复制到独立存储(参见 :ref:`ops-"
"backup`)。在没有终端时,注册仍可完成,但节点会报告该身份尚无恢复口令,直至在终端中运行 ``anet identity "
"protect``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:424
msgid "A node in a container"
msgstr "使用容器部署节点"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:426
msgid ""
"The same approach works for a node. The image holds a static ``anet`` "
"binary, a writable ``/data`` directory for the node's data and a writable"
" ``/recovery`` directory that receives the recovery file. Keep the two on"
" separate volumes so that they can be backed up and stored separately."
msgstr ""
"节点可采用相同的方式。镜像包含静态编译的 ``anet`` 二进制文件、存放节点数据的可写 ``/data`` 目录,以及接收恢复文件的可写 "
"``/recovery`` 目录。两者应使用各自独立的数据卷,以便分别备份和保存。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:454
msgid ""
"The control plane and the local A2A interface listen on the container's "
"own loopback interface and are not published; commands reach them through"
" ``docker exec``. Do not publish those ports."
msgstr "控制面与本地 A2A 接口监听容器自身的回环接口,不对外发布;命令通过 ``docker exec`` 访问它们。请勿发布这些端口。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:460
msgid "Checklist"
msgstr "检查清单"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:462
msgid "Before a hub accepts nodes from the Internet:"
msgstr "hub 接受来自互联网的节点之前,请确认:"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:464
msgid ""
"``/healthz`` answers through the public name over HTTPS, and the version "
"is the one installed most recently."
msgstr "``/healthz`` 可通过公开域名以 HTTPS 访问,且返回的版本为最近安装的版本。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:466
msgid ""
"The proxy sets ``X-Real-IP``, allows request bodies of at least "
"``--relay-max-envelope``, and keeps no access log."
msgstr "代理设置了 ``X-Real-IP``,允许的请求体不小于 ``--relay-max-envelope``,并且不保留访问日志。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:468
msgid ""
"The hub identity has a recovery passphrase, and a copy of the recovery "
"file is stored away from the host."
msgstr "hub 身份已设置恢复口令,且恢复文件的副本存放在主机之外。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:470
msgid ""
"The operator plane, when used, answers only through the proxy and its "
"token is neither a placeholder nor shared with another system."
msgstr "若使用运维面,它仅通过代理应答,其令牌不是占位值,也未与其他系统共用。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:472
msgid ""
"The daily maintenance job has run once (``roll.log`` in the data "
"directory) and a backup can be restored on a test host (:ref:`ops-"
"backup`)."
msgstr "每日维护任务已运行过一次(数据目录中的 ``roll.log``),并且备份已在测试主机上恢复验证(:ref:`ops-backup`)。"

#: ../../ops/deployment.rst:475
msgid ""
"``anet-hub admission`` shows the intended mode, and ``federation.json`` "
"lists exactly the intended peers (:ref:`ops-federation`)."
msgstr ""
"``anet-hub admission`` 显示的是预期的模式,且 ``federation.json`` 恰好列出预期的对等方(:ref"
":`ops-federation`)。"

